flowchart TD
  B[ESP32-S3 boots] --> U[Read immutable hardware UID + persisted device key]
  U --> C[POST /api/nodes/contact]
  C --> R{Registered?}
  R -->|no| P[Pending node in FarmPi]
  P --> A[Android admin: friendly name + farmer location]
  A --> E[Initial schema v2 config: every supported measurement OFF]
  R -->|yes| H{Applied fingerprint matches desired?}
  E --> H
  H -->|yes| S[IN SYNC]
  H -->|no| F[POST /api/nodes/configuration]
  F --> V[Validate schema v2, FP identity, capabilities, modes, canonical bytes + SHA-256]
  V -->|valid| N[Write inactive NVS slot + read back]
  N --> X[Switch active config and apply]
  X --> K[POST /api/nodes/ack]
  K --> S
  V -->|invalid / persistence failure| L[Keep last known-good config]
  L --> Q[Report failure for attempted fingerprint]
  Q --> D[UPDATE FAILED for current desired state]
  S --> M{Measurement mode}
  M -->|OFF| O[No acquisition or telemetry]
  M -->|SIMULATED| G[Generate value on ESP32]
  M -->|LIVE| P2[Read tested physical driver]
  G --> I[Authenticated sparse ingest: simulated=true]
  P2 --> I2[Authenticated sparse ingest: simulated=false]
  I --> DB[(MariaDB with captured location/time/provenance)]
  I2 --> DB
